    {
      "id": "w4ukirk",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. SKILL INDIA & DEMOGRAPHIC DIVIDEND LINKAGE"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "UNDP calculates HDI using four sub-indicators: Life Expectancy at Birth, Expected Years of Schooling, Mean Years of Schooling, and GNI per capita (PPP).",
        "NITI Aayog's National MPI incorporates 12 indicators, adding Maternal Health and Bank Accounts to the standard 10 global MPI indicators.",
        "National Education Policy (NEP) 2020 sets a target public expenditure on education at 6% of GDP."
      ],
      "id": "95ltyuw"
    },
